  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="7e40ebd5-a7de-54b2-965d-829f7584d315" activityNameId="54064301-0482-5941-893c-1eb682242cdc" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Brick, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Brick, at plant
not included: charge of the wastewater and solid waste, it's assumed that the waste heat is totale reused for drying, no hard coal coke is used within these 12 plants;
Synonyms: Ziegel, clay, Ton; 
UUID: d5ba924c-dc97-374c-a3de-13043d280a74
includes first ginding process, wet process (includes second ginding, mixing and plastifying), storage, forming (extruding molding method) and cutting, drying, firing, loading, packing and storage
Location: certain exchanges are proxies (CH for RER), specially for the petrol consumption the proxy "operation, passenger car" has been used; data stem from Switzerland, Germany and Austria
Technology: Mix of different technologies (different firing fuels) in A, D, CH.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: The data relates to 12 brick production plants in Germany, Austria and Switzerland; The estimation of infrastructure relates to one company in Switzerland (Ziegelei Gasser AG in Rapperswil BE), 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_d5ba924c-dc97-374c-a3de-13043d280a74.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="20a9bf48-6cea-59b4-ad08-000cb981f2d0" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
